§§ `ss 8, 8A -- how many weeks`

-- Not a mining employee (s 8). 8 2/3 = 26/3 weeks at 10 years; 4 1/3 = 13/3 more at 15, 20 ...; on termination
-- 8 2/3 x (years since the last accrual)/10.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 10 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 26 DIVIDED BY 3
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 9.99 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 14 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 26 DIVIDED BY 3
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 15 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 20 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 52 DIVIDED BY 3
-- 12 years, resigned: 26/3 + (2/10 x 26/3) = 26/3 + 26/15 = 156/15 = 10.4 weeks.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 12 `I resigned or retired for another reason` FALSE 0 EQUALS 10.4
-- 12.5 years, dismissed for serious and wilful misconduct: s 8(2)(a)(iii) applies on any termination: 26/3 + (2.5/10 x 26/3) = 65/6.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 12.5 `my employer ended it for my serious and wilful misconduct` FALSE 0 EQUALS 65 DIVIDED BY 6
-- 17 years, resigned: 13 + (2/10 x 26/3) = 13 + 26/15 = 221/15.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 17 `I resigned or retired for another reason` FALSE 0 EQUALS 221 DIVIDED BY 15
-- Between 7 and 10 years: 8 2/3 x years/10 only where s 8(3) applies.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `I resigned or retired for another reason` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `my employer ended it for a reason other than my serious and wilful misconduct` FALSE 0 EQUALS 104 DIVIDED BY 15
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `my employer ended it for my serious and wilful misconduct` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `my employer ended it for my serious and wilful misconduct` TRUE 0 EQUALS 104 DIVIDED BY 15
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `I ended it because of incapacity, or a domestic or other pressing necessity, that justified ending it` FALSE 0 EQUALS 104 DIVIDED BY 15
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 8 `I am still employed` TRUE 0 EQUALS 104 DIVIDED BY 15
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 7 `my employer ended it because of an illness that justified ending it` FALSE 0 EQUALS 91 DIVIDED BY 15
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 6.99 `my employer ended it because of an illness that justified ending it` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0
-- Leave already taken.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 15 `I am still employed` FALSE (26 DIVIDED BY 3) EQUALS 13 DIVIDED BY 3
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` FALSE 12 `I am still employed` FALSE 10 EQUALS 0
-- A mining employee (s 8A): 13 weeks for every 10 years; 13 x (years since)/10 on termination; 5 to 10 years pro rata.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 10 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 19 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 20 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 26
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 12 `I resigned or retired for another reason` FALSE 0 EQUALS 15.6
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 5 `my employer ended it for a reason other than my serious and wilful misconduct` FALSE 0 EQUALS 6.5
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 4.99 `my employer ended it for a reason other than my serious and wilful misconduct` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks of long service leave am I entitled to` TRUE 7 `I am still employed` FALSE 0 EQUALS 0

